The plane was late and we were waiting at the airport all evening.
We were expecting afamous singer from America.
A few days ago, someone posted on the internet that thissinger would come to China.
When the plane arrived, some fans were waiting inside the mainbuilding while others were outside the airport. 
Then，a man who looked like the singer got off the plane and hurried into the lounge.
Welooked at him carefully and took many photos.To our surprise, when the man took off hissunglasses, we found that he was simply an ordinary person.